{"id": "101823", "title": "气囊式体外反搏器采购项目采购意向公告", "sourceUrl": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/freecms/site/juncai/ggxx/info/2026/8a1d031d9d897c53019ea4b0451d6a48.html", "date": "2026-07-01", "source": "军队采购网", "content": "为便于供应商了解采购信息，根据《物资服务集中采购需求管理暂行办法》等有关规定，现将气囊式体外反搏器采购项目的采购意向公开如下： 序号 采购项目名称 需求概况 初步技术参数 预算金额(万元) 预计采购时间 备注 1 气囊式体外反搏器 采购内容：详见附件 采购数量：6台 主要功能或目标：详见附件 需满足的要求：详见附件 详见附件 240.00 2026年08月 无 注：1.本次意向公开的采购意向仅作为供应商了解初步采购安排的参考，采购项目具体情况以最终发布的采购公告和采购文件为准； 2.供应商可以通过采购平台反馈参与意向和意见建议。 联系人：王助理 \n采购方式: 不详\n\n<a href=\"https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d031d9d897c53019ea4b0451d6a48/59/E5A7465DF0534C97882CF468F9C4D49A\">附件1.pdf.pdf</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d031d9d897c53019ea4b0451d6a48/59/89B42AADFCF744CF9B2C18A3931E6D63\">附件2.pdf.pdf</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d031d9d897c53019ea4b0451d6a48/59/437BE8AA1B5C46329EE4C5138BDDCC4C\">附件3.pdf.pdf</a>\n\nE5A7465DF0534C97882CF468F9C4D49A\n89B42AADFCF744CF9B2C18A3931E6D63\n437BE8AA1B5C46329EE4C5138BDDCC4C", "html": "", "method": "采购意向", "region": "山东省", "buyer": "", "deadline": "", "budget": "", "attachments": [{"url": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d031d9d897c53019ea4b0451d6a48/59/E5A7465DF0534C97882CF468F9C4D49A", "name": "E5A7465DF0534C97882CF468F9C4D49A", "ext": "download", "local_file": "101823_89B42AADFCF744CF9B2C18A3931E6D63"}, {"url": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d031d9d897c53019ea4b0451d6a48/59/89B42AADFCF744CF9B2C18A3931E6D63", "name": "89B42AADFCF744CF9B2C18A3931E6D63", "ext": "download", "local_file": "101823_89B42AADFCF744CF9B2C18A3931E6D63"}, {"url": "https://www.plap.mil.cn/gateway/gp-notice-center/rest/v1/notice/url/download/8a1d031d9d897c53019ea4b0451d6a48/59/437BE8AA1B5C46329EE4C5138BDDCC4C", "name": "437BE8AA1B5C46329EE4C5138BDDCC4C", "ex